@page "/"

<h1>Access Request Hub</h1>

<p>Welcome to the Access Request Hub MVP. Use the navigation menu to:</p>

<ul>
    <li><strong>Create Request</strong> - Submit a new access request</li>
    <li><strong>My Requests</strong> - View your submitted requests</li>
    <li><strong>Approval Inbox</strong> - Review and process pending approvals</li>
</ul>

<p>Use the <strong>User Switcher</strong> in the top bar to switch between demo users.</p>

